        {
          "text": "This is modern software engineering.",
          "start": 332.721,
          "end": 336.737
        },
        {
          "text": "Take another slow breath.",
          "start": 337.101,
          "end": 340.401
        },
        {
          "text": "Observe the documentation.",
          "start": 340.761,
          "end": 343.601
        },
        {
          "text": "It is magnificent.",
          "start": 344.428,
          "end": 346.881
        },
        {
          "text": "It explains features that don't exist.",
